PN,36301
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787078908
OL,3,CBricklayer seriously injured in a roof
OL,4,Ccollapse
OL,6,FA bricklayer was left with serious
OL,7,Finjuries after a floor collapsed under
OL,8,Fhim at a building site.
OL,10,FThe 25-year-old worker was
OL,11,Fhospitalised for a month following the
OL,12,Fincident, which took place on 24 June
OL,13,F2024 at a house under construction on
OL,14,FLynn Street, Oldham.
OL,16,FWhile bricklaying on the upper level,
OL,17,Fthe floor, overloaded with concrete
OL,18,Fblocks, suddenly gave way, causing
OL,19,Fboth the worker and the materials to
OL,20,Ffall.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787078908
OL,3,CBricklayer seriously injured in a roof
OL,4,Ccollapse
OL,6,FHe sustained fractures to his right
OL,7,Fleg, hip, and left hand, requiring
OL,8,Fsurgery and an extended hospital stay.
OL,10,FA Health and Safety Executive (HSE)
OL,11,Finvestigation found that Oldham
OL,12,FBusiness and Construction Management
OL,13,FLimited, the site's principal
OL,14,Fcontractor, had failed to properly
OL,15,Fplan, manage, and monitor work on site.
OL,17,FThe collapsed floor had been
OL,18,Foverloaded and not built according to
OL,19,Fthe manufacturer's design.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787078908
OL,3,CBricklayer seriously injured in a roof
OL,4,Ccollapse
OL,6,FInspectors also uncovered a series of
OL,7,Fother safety failings, including
OL,8,Funsafe scaffolding, inadequate
OL,9,Farrangements for working at height, a
OL,10,Flack of fire alarms, and insufficient
OL,11,Fsite management.
OL,13,FFollowing the inspection, HSE issued
OL,14,Fmultiple enforcement notices. The
OL,15,Fcompany, based on Bath Street, pleaded
OL,16,Fguilty to breaching Regulation 13(1)
OL,17,Fof the Construction (Design and
OL,18,FManagement) Regulations 2015.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787078908
OL,3,CBricklayer seriously injured in a roof
OL,4,Ccollapse
OL,6,FAt Warrington Magistrates' Court, on
OL,7,F11 August 2026, Oldham Business and
OL,8,FConstruction Management Limited was
OL,9,Ffined #30,000 and ordered to pay
OL,10,F#4,883 in costs.
OL,12,FHSE Inspector Karen Farley said: "The
OL,13,Finjuries suffered by this worker were
OL,14,Fthe consequence of fundamental
OL,15,Ffailures to manage health and safety.
OL,17,F"Our investigation revealed that this
OL,18,Fwas not an isolated failing but part
OL,19,Fof a broader pattern of poor health
OL,20,Fand safety standards across the site."
OL,26,@tD@bOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1787078908
OL,3,CBricklayer seriously injured in a roof
OL,4,Ccollapse
OL,6,FShe continued: "The construction
OL,7,Findustry remains one of the highest-
OL,8,Frisk sectors, and employers must
OL,9,Fensure that work is properly planned,
OL,10,Fsupervised and carried out safely.
OL,12,F"This incident was entirely
OL,13,Fforeseeable and could have been
OL,14,Fprevented had the floor been
OL,15,Fconstructed in accordance with the
OL,16,Fmanufacturer's instructions and safe
OL,17,Fsystems of work been in place to
OL,18,Fensure it was not overloaded with
OL,19,Fconstruction materials."
OL,26,@nD@POU{D@XO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/5
